Package: huer
Title: Client for the 'Philips Hue' Bridge API V2 and Bridge Pro
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(
      given = "Michael",
      family = "Wild",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      email = "michael.wild@me.com"
    )
Description: Provides a complete 'httr2'-based client for the 'Philips Hue'
    'CLIP' API v2 and Bridge Pro local HTTPS endpoints, covering all GET,
    POST, PUT, and DELETE resource operations, bridge discovery,
    authentication, and real-time Server-Sent Events ('SSE') streaming. API
    responses are parsed into tidy tibbles using 'jsonlite', with structured
    diagnostics powered by 'cli'.
